也许你可以学学你的朋友拉杰
Maybe you could try being more thoughtful,

373
00:14:55,130 --> 00:14:56,600
更体贴一些
like your friend Raj.

374
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:59,410
也许你可以学学拉杰
Yeah, well, maybe you could try being more like Raj.

375
00:14:59,410 --> 00:15:00,920
-是吗  -当然
- Oh, really? - Yeah, yeah.

376
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,470
他今天早上为我打包了午餐
