379
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,880
现在还要为你打包午餐吗
Now I need to pack your lunch?

380
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,600
而且  你为什么需要字条来告诉你
And by the way, why do you need a note telling you

381
