有精神支持感觉会更好
when I'm going and getting them!

386
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:23,080
别这样  瞧你们在说些什么话
Hey, hey, do you hear yourselves?

387
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:26,880
咱们冷静下  都各退一步
Let's just, you know, all calm down and take a step back.

388
00:15:28,070 --> 00:15:29,710
太傻了  我们为什么要吵架
This is stupid. Why are we fighting?

389
00:15:29,710 --> 00:15:30,630
我不知道
I don't know.

390
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:33,950
我想是因为我觉得自己是个差劲的老公
I guess I was just feeling like I'm a lousy husband.

391
00:15:33,950 --> 00:15:35,260
你不是差劲的老公
You're not a lousy husband.

392
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:36,940
你是个非常棒的老公
You're a great husband.

393
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:39,270
我才觉得自己是个差劲的老婆
I was the one feeling like a lousy wife.

394
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:41,300
开什么玩笑  你最棒了
Are you kidding? You're the best.

395
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,730
我知道问题在哪里
I know what the problem is.

396
00:15:42,730 --> 00:15:44,230
都怪他
It's him!

397
00:15:45,550 --> 00:15:47,270
我做了什么
Oh, what did I do?

398
00:15:47,270 --> 00:15:49,150
你让我们觉得  我们经营婚姻不够用心
You made us feel like we're not trying hard enough.

399
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:51,570
我们之前很满意我们打混摸鱼的婚姻
Yeah, we were totally fine half-assing our marriage

400
00:15:51,570 --> 00:15:53,230
直到你这个祸害出现
till you showed up.

401
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:56,070
我很抱歉让你们生气了
Look, I'm sorry you're upset with me,

402
00:15:56,070 --> 00:15:57,700
但我得说  看到你们统一战线
but I just have to say it's nice to see

403
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:59,460
真是太好了
the two of you on the same page.

404
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:01,340
