你这人怎么整天淫虫上脑啊
Oh, everything is just sex with you isn't it?

424
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:58,720
谢尔顿  你得意识到
Sheldon, I think you might find the support

425
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,320
想在恋爱中得到多少扶持
you're looking for, if you realize that

426
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:02,550
全取决于自己有多少付出
