438
00:17:32,770 --> 00:17:33,950
证明是错的
Dr. Leonard Hofstadter.

439
00:17:33,950 --> 00:17:35,600
先生们  欢迎来到《科学星期五》做客
Welcome to Science Friday, gentlemen.

440
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:36,750
-谢谢  -谢谢你
- Thanks. - Thank you.

441
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:39,910
艾拉  容我说一句  我想为
Ira, if I may, I'd like to apologize

