445
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:49,220
没有
No.

446
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:51,650
霍夫斯塔德博士
Now, Dr. Hofstadter.

447
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:53,020
你能讲述一遍你推翻
Can you walk us through the process

