461
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,920
可悲的是  他不能使之成为现实
Which, sadly, he couldn't build

462
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:25,120
因为圣诞老人没有送他浓缩铀
because Santa wouldn't bring him enriched uranium.

463
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:27,500
你没意见的话  我真的很想听
I mean, I'd really like to hear it from Dr. Hofstadter,

464
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,140
霍夫斯塔德博士说说
if it's okay with you.

465
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,700
好意外啊
